# Derived eval caches — audio/PV/pivot artefacts that the harnesses re-create on
# demand (e.g. eval/live/run-matrix.ts:preparePcm re-fetches from Kaltura and
# re-transcodes when the file is absent). These were tracked by accident and put
# 212 MB of raw PCM into git history; purged 2026-07-30, see the note in
# eval/live/README.md. The glob is deliberately broad so the next eval
# subsystem's cache/ is covered without another incident.
eval/**/cache/
